WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:00.530
{preview}

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:03.740
Everyone, duck!

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.480
Who are they?

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.120
I do not believe they are really from the fire department.

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:18.510
Mom!

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:24.670
That's Takagi's mom!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.400
They're saved!

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:30.690
Our situation, on the other hand, does not bode well.

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:32.780
I do not believe they will come help us.

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
Let's take a detour. I know my way around this area.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.320
We'll be waiting!

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:45.530
We'll be waiting at my house!

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:21.760
Yureta Genjitsukan Nakushita Mama de

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:21.760
As I lose my shaky touch with reality,

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:26.810
Gareki no Youni Tsumikasanaru

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:26.810
my emotions pile up like fallen debris

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:31.090
Kono Kanshou wa Doko e Yuku

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:31.090
Where do they think they're going?

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.360
Tsuieta Kibou Kakae

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.360
With my crushed hope in tow,

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:41.320
Akai Ame o Harai Hashitta Muchuu ni

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:41.320
I frantically ran straight through the bloody rain

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:47.980
Kuzureta Kanjou no Hate ni

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:47.980
After my emotions come spilling out,

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.280
Nani o Miru

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.280
what will I see?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.550
Nani ga Aru

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.550
What will I have?

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.230
Mada Shiranai

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.230
I still don't know

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:58.110
Hakanai Subete no Mirai wa

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:58.110
But in this silence,

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.680
Tada Muon ni Me no Mae ni

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.680
all of the fragile outcomes

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:07.690
Hirogari Tsudzuketa

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:07.690
lie endlessly before me

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:27.270
They're here too.

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:30.220
It does not seem as though we can make it back to 2-chome.

00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:31.880
Let's go back this way.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.250
There were none of them on the way here.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.560
I can even see Takagi's house from here...

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.830
Do you want to walk on a fence again?

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:53.380
If I just had a bike...

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.980
Saeko!

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:05.490
I'll pick out a bike.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:08.600
Get whatever you need, Saeko.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:12.860
A bike is okay by itself, but in
tandem it would be dangerous.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.190
Or are we going on a date?

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.280
Would this work?

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:34.130
You can use it in water?

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.830
So you find it satisfactory?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:48.290
What an amusing situation we find ourselves in.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.020
Yeah, really.

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:52.290
So what shall we do from hereafter?

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.410
I assume you have a plan?

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:55.580
Yup!

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.250
But...

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.430
But?

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.780
Things could get a little too amusing.

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:05.530
Gosh. Never change.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.120
Hang on!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:26.110
They can use the stairs, but not a sleep slope?

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:27.740
Say what you please, but...

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.490
They're the same in the end, huh?

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:38.830
That would be too easy.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.060
Well then...

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.070
What are you doing, Komuro?

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:46.160
Using it amphibiously!

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.100
Amphibiously?

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.920
Saeko, are you o-kaaay?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:05.800
Uhhhhhh.

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.660
I-I am a woman!

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.780
Oh, yes! Sorry...

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:46.840
It is not admirable for a young man to sigh.

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:48.550
Uh, okay.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:50.340
But, wait, Saeko...

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:51.380
You're too close...

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.720
How about you keep your voice down now?

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:03.950
Good idea to use the sandbank.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:08.260
I remember when I was a kid and I was always told not to play here

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.720
because the water is so deep and the stream is really fast.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.860
Now then.

00:06:14.860 --> 00:06:19.130
Regardless of whether things work out or not, we should rest.

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:22.160
Okay. We'll take turns standing guard.

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.630
Saeko, you can rest firs—

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:31.530
I-I apologize... My body seems to have gotten cold.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:34.110
Oh yeah. We got splashed before...

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.330
Well, you can use this for now.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.100
Thank you.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.200
You can turn around now.

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.690
Do I look strange?

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:20.110
N-No!

00:07:20.110 --> 00:07:21.040
It's the other way around!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.070
Uh.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.780
You always look at me as a
woman, don't you, Komuro?

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.650
Uh... Would you rather...

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:30.630
Sor—

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:31.880
It is fine.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.910
I am a woman, aren't I?

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:47.210
Is there someone you like, Saeko?

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.030
That came out of the blue.

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.500
Er, well...

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:54.510
What the hell am I saying...

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:58.350
I just thought...

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.370
There is...

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.660
...a man who I like.

00:08:13.190 --> 00:08:14.870
Should we leave now?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.180
There are less of them.

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.290
Ah, yeah.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.240
More of them.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.930
As it stands, we will just have a repeat of the sandbank.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:41.770
We'll know when we turn at the next corner!

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:47.120
A park?

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.710
Doesn't mean we have to make a cardboard box house!

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:07.710
Do you like making girls wet?

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:10.420
Get the tape out of the backpack!

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.850
I see.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.350
While they are drawn in by the noise...

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:34.420
We can go out the east exit and we'll end up behind Takagi's house.

00:09:34.420 --> 00:09:38.880
I don't wanna use the gun very much because of the echo...

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:43.870
I see.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.560
Understood!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.540
What a foul smell.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.310
You should at least wash your hair.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.240
Now...

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.490
I have no reason to hold back!

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:25.410
Y-You're pretty cool, Saeko...

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:43.330
What're you doing, Saeko?!

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.650
What's the matter?

00:10:58.760 --> 00:10:59.780
Here!

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.300
Hurry!

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:23.260
What happened, Saeko?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.750
Traveling around at night would be dangerous with what supplies we have now.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.780
We'll wait here for morning.

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:54.790
Hey, this is a real sword.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.630
Here you go, Saeko.

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:04.610
You should sit down over here first.

00:12:04.610 --> 00:12:06.070
Your uniform is dry too.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:40.380
I am done changing.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.620
I feel much better now.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.570
We have one, Saeko.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.910
We have one what?

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.600
What indeed.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.790
One of these.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:07.030
This is a portable toilet, Milady Saeko.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.040
Why you...

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:16.740
Hey, don't laugh about that!

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:19.070
This way, we won't have to worry about...

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.710
Yes, I know.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.340
I...

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.170
I am happy.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.510
You are not going to pry?

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:43.280
Well, it must be pretty big reason for you to freeze up like that...

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:58.870
It might not mean anything to you...

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.960
But regardless, do you mind hearing me out?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:13.180
I recalled when I was last so...

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.290
Afraid.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.640
Was it because you saw the children?

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.490
Though troubling, no, that was not it.

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:29.660
When we were by the river bank, you asked if there was a man who I liked.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.790
Oh, that, uh...

00:14:32.790 --> 00:14:34.160
Do not worry.

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:36.250
I do think like a woman,

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.680
and there is a man who I like.

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:41.590
But...

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:44.520
I did not convey my feelings to him.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.520
I did not believe that I should be allowed to do so.

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:50.460
But why? I mean, no matter what kind of guy...

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:52.970
Do you think he would have accepted me if I had committed murder?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:00.930
It was four years ago.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:03.550
A man attacked me at night.

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:08.720
I had my training sword with me, so naturally I was able to fend him off.

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:14.110
I broke his shoulder blade and femur.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:19.570
The police understood the situation and took me back home in the patrol car.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:24.440
Then they might have thought it was an excessive way to defend yourself...

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:28.100
That is not what has been holding me back.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.610
I enjoyed it.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.300
I had a clearly defined enemy.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.690
It was thrilling.

00:15:46.230 --> 00:15:52.890
Once I knew that I was on top because of my training sword,

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.590
I pretended to be afraid,

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:56.120
lured him in,

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.450
and struck back without hesitation.

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:08.110
And I enjoyed it.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.890
I truly, truly enjoyed it.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:15.090
That is the real me!

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.940
The true nature of Saeko Busujima!

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:24.190
Do you really believe that I, drunk and turned on by my own power,

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.570
should be allowed something pure like love?!{liberal. as. dicks.}

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:29.940
But ever since they appeared, I...

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.820
But you changed after the fact.

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.160
I have been like this since before it all began.

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:40.790
Saeko...

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.640
As we stood in front of the water fountain,

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:46.190
I came to realize that I have not changed.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:49.300
On the contrary, I find myself becoming even crueler.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.790
Let's go out the back.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.690
It'll take us 20 minutes to walk to Takagi's—

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:51.480
What the?!

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:54.530
Was it the sound of the leaves?

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:56.010
No, there's no way.

00:17:57.120 --> 00:17:58.550
Why?!

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:01.200
Run, Saeko!

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:08.960
Saeko!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.620
Komuro?

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.010
Komuro...

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:26.780
If you need a reason, I'll give you one!

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:30.930
Saeko, no matter how dirty your hands are,

00:18:30.930 --> 00:18:35.440
I'll always look up to you!

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:38.740
I think you're the coolest girl I've ever met!

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.300
So don't just die!

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:42.330
I don't wanna die!

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:47.620
Please, keep living! For my sake!

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:50.310
Live as yourself and bear your sins!

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:06.990
